[h2]Build 0.9.11[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]Power cells: a suit's cells drain while it is piloted (a power bar shows how much is left). When they run dry the servos stop and the pilot can barely move. The Bulwark carries one cell, the Bughunter two.
[*]Suit charging rack (Misc tab): recharges suits left standing next to it while it has power.
[*]Backpacks, fitted to a standing suit like an arm, each holding three cells. Bulwark shield generator pack: stand still for a moment and a shield bubble soaks up every kind of damage while the pilot keeps firing; taking a step drops it; it draws power while up and for every hit, and can be switched off. Bughunter jump pack: leap to a spot nearby, at a big power cost.
[*]Bughunter net launcher: fire a net that pins insects for several seconds and slows anything else. Holds three nets; load more at the standing suit, twenty textiles a net.
[/list]
